            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Prince Haldric has arrived at Fallen Lich Point, to retrieve Lich-Lord Caror’s Book of Fire and Darkness, and flee into the sewers of Southbay."),
